<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ERPM in talks, issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>ERPM in talks, issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>East Rand Proprietary Mines Ltd on Thursday advised that negotiations were taking place which could have an effect on the share price of the company.</p>
<p>It advised shareholders to exercise caution in share dealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
